    <p>
      occurrences happen before time <m>w</m> or <m>P(X \lt \alpha)</m> for
      <m>X</m> a Poison random variable on the interval <m>[0,w]</m> with parameter
      <fillin characters="25"/>.
    </p>
    </statement>
  </task>
  <task workspace=".25">
    <statement>
      <p>
         We know from the last chapter that
